{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-01-12 03:00:00', 'title': 'SAILGP RACES TO REVOLUTIONISE COMPETITIVE SAILING WITH NETSUITE', 'text': "NETSUITE HELPS SAILGP MANAGE ITS FINANCIAL OPERATIONS AND MAKE STRATEGIC BUSINESS DECISIONS AS IT EXPANDS SINGAPORE , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SINGAPORE SAIL GRAND PRIX -- SAILGP, THE FAST-GROWING PURPOSE-LED GLOBAL RACING LEAGUE, IS USING ORACLE NETSUITE\xa0TO SUPPORT ITS MISSION TO CHANGE THE FACE OF COMPETITIVE SAILING.\xa0WITH NETSUITE, SAILGP HAS TAKEN ADVANTAGE OF AN INTEGRATED BUSINESS SYSTEM TO MANAGE FINANCIAL PROCESSES IN NEW COUNTRIES, BROADCAST OPPORTUNITIES, AND REVENUE STREAMS AS IT AIMS TO DOUBLE THE LEAGUE'S SIZE WITHIN TWO YEARS."}